[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS transition process includes deployment planning, training, operational handover, and ongoing support for military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for transition procedures.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document covers transition planning, referenced documents, transition procedures, and support arrangements per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports successful system transition.

[[/SECTION]]

