[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 3. Transition planning

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-003-MILUAV
TITLE: Deployment Planning
STATEMENT: Deployment planning includes site preparation, infrastructure setup, personnel training, and operational readiness assessment for military deployment.
RATIONALE: Deployment planning ensures successful system transition.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-004-MILUAV
TITLE: Training Planning
STATEMENT: Training planning includes operator training, maintenance training, and support personnel training with certification requirements for military operations.
RATIONALE: Training planning ensures competent system operation.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-005-MILUAV
TITLE: Support Planning
STATEMENT: Support planning includes technical support, maintenance support, and operational support arrangements for ongoing military operations.
RATIONALE: Support planning ensures sustained system operation.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-006-MILUAV
TITLE: Risk Management
STATEMENT: Risk management includes transition risks, mitigation strategies, and contingency plans for military system deployment.
RATIONALE: Risk management ensures successful transition and operation.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 4. Transition procedures

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-007-MILUAV
TITLE: Pre-Transition Activities
STATEMENT: Pre-transition activities include system validation, personnel preparation, infrastructure verification, and operational readiness assessment.
RATIONALE: Pre-transition activities ensure readiness for transition.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-008-MILUAV
TITLE: System Deployment
STATEMENT: System deployment includes installation, configuration, testing, and validation at operational sites with military oversight.
RATIONALE: System deployment enables operational capability.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-009-MILUAV
TITLE: Personnel Training
STATEMENT: Personnel training includes classroom instruction, hands-on practice, certification testing, and operational familiarization for military operators.
RATIONALE: Personnel training ensures competent system operation.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-010-MILUAV
TITLE: Operational Handover
STATEMENT: Operational handover includes system acceptance, operational responsibility transfer, and ongoing support establishment for military operations.
RATIONALE: Operational handover ensures successful system transition.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 5. Support arrangements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-011-MILUAV
TITLE: Technical Support
STATEMENT: Technical support includes help desk services, remote diagnostics, on-site support, and technical documentation for military operations.
RATIONALE: Technical support ensures system reliability and availability.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-012-MILUAV
TITLE: Maintenance Support
STATEMENT: Maintenance support includes preventive maintenance, corrective maintenance, spare parts, and maintenance training for military systems.
RATIONALE: Maintenance support ensures system performance and longevity.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-013-MILUAV
TITLE: Operational Support
STATEMENT: Operational support includes mission planning assistance, operational procedures, and performance optimization for military operations.
RATIONALE: Operational support ensures mission success and effectiveness.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 6. Notes

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STM-014-MILUAV
TITLE: Transition Success Criteria
STATEMENT: Transition success criteria include system operational capability, personnel competency, support infrastructure, and mission readiness for military deployment.
RATIONALE: Transition success criteria ensure successful system transition and operation.

[[/SECTION]] 